  "question": {
    "text": "Let a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;pass through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and have slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> for all positive real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;pass through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and have slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> for all positive real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>.&nbsp;<p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=2</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
